From ac771bb7e40a56dca6ca55836aa9cf7e4fee8756 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre <andre@rng.media>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:26:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] CutCat: RNG Media patches on FilmCraft

Branding (name, icon, wordmark, About), glass theme, Premiere-style Home
on startup, Tabler icons, playhead-anchored zoom, ruler-wheel zoom,
double-click gap ripple delete, fade handles, rounded clips, no Discord
links, no upstream update check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
